/-!
# KFY 19: the cost of the two passes for `n` (natural-number part)

For `n` past a threshold (`NG n`):

* every per-axis bound splits as `Ctr + main + overN n`, with `main` linear in `2^L` and
  **`overN n = 10^80 (p+1)^12 (2^ℓ + 2)^3`** collecting the tables and constant overheads
  (`axA_le`, `axB_le`);
* **`over_le`**: `(3d + 1) · overN n + 2 + d (d+1) (ℓ + p + d + 2)² + d ≤ 2^L`, since
  `L ≥ 4ℓ − 4` (`d ≥ 4`) and `2^ℓ` beats every fixed power of `ℓ` (`bigpow`);
* **`ZN_le`**: the per-element factor `Z = Φ + mm + Bacc + Q + 2 ≤ cZ (p + 1)(lq + 1)^6`;
* **`JE_le`**: `(Jb + 1)(2E + 2) ≤ 24 ⌈√p⌉ α` (the `B₀` rounds), from `α⁴ ≥ 12 d² b`.
